comments.body:
A bit more explicit:
- We don't hand anything *back* to a worker, it'd be the first time we hand it to a worker
- There's no workers in the test anyway

```suggestion
                // TryReadRequest() returns empty if the HTTPRemoteClient is still
                // holding on to the request. In this test the request is guaranteed
                // to be incomplete although in production it may a result of
                // a busy worker or a full send buffer.
```

